+
+ -- Stephen Kitt <skitt@debian.org>  Fri, 22 Jan 2021 17:39:15 +0100
+
+gcc-mingw-w64 (24) unstable; urgency=medium
+
+  * Following MSYS2 and Fedora’s example (among others), switch from SJLJ
